## Document standard texts

## Document standard texts
faction-doc-founding = DOCUMENT ESTABLISHING THE CREATION OF THE STATE «{$name}»\n\nWe, the undersigned, by the authority vested in us through the exercise of our sovereign will, do hereby proclaim, declare, and establish the creation of a new independent state — «{$name}» (hereinafter referred to as "the State").\n\nArticle 1. Foundation.\nThe State «{$name}» is founded on this day as a free, sovereign, and self-governing entity. Its existence is absolute and indisputable from the moment of the signing of this document.\n\nArticle 2. Sovereignty.\nThe State exercises full and exclusive authority over its territory, citizens, and internal affairs. No external force may interfere with the governance of the State without the express consent of its leadership.\n\nArticle 3. Citizenship.\nAll individuals who sign this document are recognized as the founding citizens of the State. Citizenship may be extended to others through the procedure established by the leadership.\n\nArticle 4. Governance.\nThe founding leader, who is the first signatory of this document, assumes the highest authority in the State. The leader has the right to establish laws, appoint officials, and represent the State in all matters.\n\nWe, the founders of «{$name}», pledge with our honor and our lives to defend the integrity, independence, and prosperity of the State. Long live «{$name}»!

faction-doc-entry = DOCUMENT ON JOINING THE STATE «{$name}»\n\nI, the undersigned, being of sound mind and free will, hereby express my solemn desire and intention to become a full citizen of the State «{$name}» (hereinafter referred to as "the State").\n\nArticle 1. Voluntary Decision.\nI confirm that my decision to join the State is made voluntarily, without coercion, threat, or deception. I fully understand the rights and obligations that citizenship entails.\n\nArticle 2. Loyalty.\nUpon signing this document, I pledge my unwavering loyalty to the State «{$name}» and its leadership. I swear to protect the interests, secrets, and security of the State with all my strength.\n\nArticle 3. Obligations.\nAs a citizen of the State, I undertake to:\n— Strictly obey all laws and decrees issued by the leadership of the State;\n— Contribute to the well-being and prosperity of the State to the best of my ability;\n— Protect the State from any threats, internal or external;\n— Never betray the trust placed in me by my fellow citizens and the leadership.\n\nArticle 4. Rights.\nAs a citizen, I am granted the protection of the State, the right to participate in its affairs, and the right to appeal to the leadership for justice and assistance.\n\nI bind myself to the fate of «{$name}» from this day forth, for as long as the State exists or until my official withdrawal.

faction-doc-leave = DOCUMENT ON WITHDRAWAL FROM THE STATE «{$name}»\n\nI, the undersigned, a citizen of the State «{$name}» (hereinafter referred to as "the State"), do hereby declare my official and irrevocable withdrawal from the citizenship of the State.\n\nArticle 1. Grounds for Withdrawal.\nMy decision to leave the State is made of my own free will. I confirm that no coercion or duress has been applied to me, and I bear no ill will toward the State, its leadership, or its citizens.\n\nArticle 2. Release from Obligations.\nFrom the moment this document is signed, I am fully and unconditionally released from all obligations, pledges, and allegiances previously undertaken toward the State. I shall no longer be bound by its laws, decrees, or decisions.\n\nArticle 3. Renunciation of Rights.\nSimultaneously, I renounce all rights and privileges granted to me as a citizen of the State. I shall make no claims against the State, its property, or its citizens from this day forward.\n\nArticle 4. Finality.\nThis withdrawal is final and irrevocable. The State «{$name}» and I part ways peacefully and respectfully, each to follow our own path. I wish the State and its people prosperity and success.

faction-doc-govern = DOCUMENT ON THE GOVERNANCE OF THE STATE «{$name}»\n\nBy the supreme authority vested in the founding principles of the State «{$name}» (hereinafter referred to as "the State"), this document hereby confers upon its bearer the full and unquestionable right to govern the affairs of the State.\n\nArticle 1. Authority of the Bearer.\nThe bearer of this document is recognized as the highest authority of the State. All citizens, officials, and residents of the State are obliged to recognize this authority and submit to it without reservation.\n\nArticle 2. Powers and Rights.\nThe bearer of this document is granted the following exclusive rights:\n— To rename the State and redefine its identity, symbols, and principles;\n— To disband the State if its continuation is deemed impossible, undesirable, or contrary to the interests of its members;\n— To expel citizens who violate the laws of the State, endanger its security, or act against its interests;\n— To issue decrees, orders, and directives binding on all citizens and residents of the State;\n— To represent the State in all external relations, negotiations, and agreements;\n— To appoint and dismiss officials of the State at the bearer's discretion.\n\nArticle 3. Indivisibility of Power.\nThe authority granted by this document is indivisible and non-transferable, except through the explicit transfer of this document to a successor designated by the bearer.\n\nArticle 4. Supremacy.\nThis document constitutes the highest legal and symbolic authority within the State. No law, decree, or decision may contradict or supersede the will of the bearer of this document.\n\nLet all who see this document recognize and submit to the authority it represents — for it is the will of «{$name}».

faction-doc-cell = DOCUMENT ON THE ESTABLISHMENT OF THE CELL «{$name}» FOR THE PERSONAL USE OF ITS MEMBERS\n\nThis document certifies the foundation of a private community known as the cell «{$name}» (hereinafter referred to as "the Cell"), created for the personal benefit, mutual assistance, and shared interests of its members.\n\nArticle 1. Nature and Purpose.\nThe Cell «{$name}» is established as a voluntary association of individuals united by common goals and mutual trust. The Cell exists to serve the personal needs and interests of its members.\n\nArticle 2. Membership.\nThe Cell consists of the founder and such individuals invited by the founder to join. All members are equal within the Cell, bound by the same obligations and entitled to the same benefits.\n\nArticle 3. Obligations of Members.\nEvery member of the Cell is bound by the following duties:\n— Loyalty to the Cell and its members;\n— Mutual aid and support to all fellow members;\n— Compliance with the internal decisions of the Cell's leadership;\n— Non-disclosure of the Cell's internal affairs.\n\nArticle 4. Duration.\nThe Cell exists for as long as its members uphold its principles. The founder has the right to disband the Cell if circumstances require.\n\nLet this document serve as the testament of the founding of «{$name}» — a community created for the personal use of its members.
faction-doc-comment-label = Comment from the document author

